+     (HTTP 403), an unknown deployment or API version (HTTP 404) or any other error stops the
+     deployment. HTTP 429 means the resource accepted the request and is throttled; after three
+     attempts the check passes with a warning.
+   - **When printer-data credentials were passed as parameters** (the offer never collects them): a
+     sign-in and a test query against the Log Analytics workspace.
